      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 169
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You know, it’s even bringing back some nostalgic\nmemories.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F00750020006B006E006F0077002C002000690074201900730020006500760065006E0020006200720069006E00670069006E00670020006200610063006B00200073006F006D00650020006E006F007300740061006C006700690063000A006D0065006D006F0072006900650073002E00100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I used to ride Skiddo all over the city when I was\nlittle...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490020007500730065006400200074006F0020007200690064006500200053006B006900640064006F00200061006C006C0020006F0076006500720020007400680065002000630069007400790020007700680065006E002000490020007700610073000A006C006900740074006C0065002E002E002E00100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "In a way, it’s like I’ve managed to bottle the aroma\nof Lumiose from the past!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If we ask other Pokémon species to help us, I bet\nwe’ll be able to create different perfumes that<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nhave all sorts of charms!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 131
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Perhaps I’ll ask for your assistance with that\nsomeday soon.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
